From 230036aae5bc74867cd759d909d31246aa6d4a89 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Shammah Chancellor <shammah.chancellor@notvalid.com>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 01:33:30 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] miner(v2): adapt O(1) Merklix overlay BlockAssembler to V2
 state_root and monetary burn

Adapt BlockAssembler and ComputeV2StateRootFromOverlay to compute the
134-byte V2 header state_root and monetary state in O(1).

Original-Commit: 371848476ce00d3d7b1fe633f59cd71ac8276d23
Original-Patch: v2/017
Split-Concern: whole

Historical compilation prerequisites are tracked separately in daemon/patch-audit;
this provenance-preserving split does not imply standalone build validation.

Candidate-Application-Repair: Context-only three-way application repair against the preserved repaired prefix; retain the patch additions/removals and review final endpoint diff before semantics claims.
